   "white-noise"
  ],
  "description": "Village on the river in spring. Left the birds at the river, right hand the birds in the village.\n\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/Uiterwaard_bij_Bokhoven_rond_half_tien_ochtend.jpg/800px-Uiterwaard_bij_Bokhoven_rond_half_tien_ochtend.jpg\">\nA ship is approaching in the distance to the left, but it is barely audible.\nThe hoarse voice of an Egyptian goose. The typical creaking song of the starling. He mimics all kinds of birds, so when he's around you have to watch out if he doesn't cheat you with his copying. A Robin, a Chiffchaff and in the distance a Eurasian Green Woodpecker. In the trees a Collared Dove and a Wood Pigeon. Just the sound of a distant tractor.\n\n<a href=\"https://freesound.org/search/?q=230405+bokhoven&amp;f=&amp;w=&amp;tm=0&amp;s=Automatic+by+relevance&amp;advanced=0&amp;g=&amp;only_p=&amp;cm=0&amp;mm=0\" rel=\"nofollow\">More here today</a> / <a href=\"https://freesound.org/search/?q=klankbeeld+bokhoven+river+village&amp;f=&amp;w=&amp;tm=0&amp;s=Rating+%28highest+first%29&amp;advanced=0&amp;g=&amp;only_p=&amp;cm=0&amp;mm=0\" rel=\"nofollow\">More here during the year</a>\n\nDate/time: April 5th 2023, 09:54\n\nWeather: 6-8c, sun, wind E 2-10 km/h, 1023 hPa, humidity 69%, visibility 10 km, dew point 0c, UV-index 1.2-1.5\n\nLocation; river dike near Sint Corneliusweg, village Bokhoven, Noord-Brabant, Netherlands (Holland), Europe GPS:  51.73883 5.23097 \n\nGear chain: Sennheiser mkh30/50 MS, in Rycote cyclone small, windjammer &gt; Sound Devices 302 &gt;Tascam dr-100 Mk2. Decoded Mid-side to STEREO. microphone pointed E 102 degree, nouse floor 44 dBA\n\n\nIf any of these sounds have been of help, and you are feeling charitable, please do consider<b> <a href=\"https://www.freesound.org/donations/donate/\" rel=\"nofollow\">donating to Freesound</a> </b>to help keep the site running (a link is also on the home page). Any donations are greatly appreciated!\n\n\nYOU ALWAYS HAVE TO CREDIT/ATTRIBUTE me (klankbeeld) and <a href=\"http://freesound.org\" rel=\"nofollow\">freesound.org</a> in your work if you use this sound.\n\nPlease do it like this if possible: <a href=\"https://freesound.org/people/klankbeeld/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://freesound.org/people/klankbeeld/</a>;\n\nThank you.",
